                "id": "O77059"
              }
            ],
            "value": "Nuclear translocation initiates after the perception of a light signal. Accumulates in the perinuclear region about one hour before translocation into the nucleus. Translocation occurs through interaction with other Clock proteins such as tim and per (By similarity)"
          }
